  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction</strong>: Wonderfur is an innovative pet wellness brand from Australia, dedicated to enhancing pet health through scientifically-backed and nature-inspired products. We offer high-quality, freeze-dried functional treats and supplements designed to support pets' skin, coat, digestive health, immune system, and overall well-being.&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; Product description:</strong> Our flagship product, Wonderfur Bites, is Australia&rsquo;s first freeze-dried yogurt treat for pets, retaining 97% of live cultures and nutrients. Made with premium, human-grade ingredients like lactose-free kefir, green-lipped mussel, and colostrum, our products are designed to address common pet health concerns in a tasty, convenient form.&nbsp;<br>&bull;<strong> USP (Unique Selling Point): </strong>Wonderfur Bites are the first of their kind in Australia, combining probiotics, superfoods, and whole food ingredients in a freeze-dried form to target 10 common pet health issues. Trusted by veterinarians and adored by pets, Wonderfur stands out for its scientific approach and commitment to quality.&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong> Flexible commission structures with prompt monthly payouts, designed to reward affiliates for their contribution to our growing brand. Detailed terms can be customized for high-performing affiliates.&nbsp;<br>&bull;<strong> Other information: </strong>Wonderfur is committed to eco-friendly practices, using recyclable materials and sourcing locally where possible. We also support animal welfare through various charitable initiatives. Join our affiliate program and be part of a brand that pet owners trust and pets love!&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>",
